PYSearch", "full_name": "ko1o/PYSearch", "description": "一款综合（QQ 音乐、微信、美团、优酷、虎牙直播等多款 App）风格的搜索控制器\n\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/ko1o/PYSearch", "stars": 3771, "forks": 733, "watch": 86, "image_path": "/i/WwBhxjMtbyE72GC.png", "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2017-04-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 1, "category_name": "Python 项目", "items": [{"rid": "b161fdb57efa4a78baabbfa5482c7816", "name": "algorithms", "full_name": "keon/algorithms", "description": "基本算法、数据结构的 Python 实现\n```\n.\n├── array\n│   ├── circular_counter.py\n│   └── ...\n├── backtrack\n│   ├── anagram.py\n│   └── ...\n├── bfs\n│   ├── shortest_distance_from_all_buildings.py\n│   └── word_ladder.py\n├── bit\n│   ├── count_ones.py\n│   └── ...\n│   └── traversal.py\n└── 等等\n```\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/keon/algorithms", "stars": 25588, "forks": 4706, "watch": 615, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2017-04-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "ead74e7445df45b8bd032dc6ec21a13d", "name": "grequests", "full_name": "spyoungtech/grequests", "description": "Rquests + Gevent 让异步 HTTP 变得简单、人性化。示例代码：\n```python\n>>> import grequests\n>>> def exception_handler(request, exception):\n...    print \"Request failed\"\n\n>>> reqs = [\n...    grequests.get('http://httpbin.org/delay/1', timeout=0.001),\n...    grequests.get('http://fakedomain/'),\n...    grequests.get('http://httpbin.org/status/500')]\n>>> grequests.map(reqs, exception_handler=exception_handler)\nRequest failed\nRequest failed\n[None, None, <Response [500]>]\n```\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/spyoungtech/grequests", "stars": 4566, "forks": 328, "watch": 108, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2017-04-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "cf0c9dfe4eb84384a1031d3f28c2784c", "name": "ltp", "full_name": "HIT-SCIR/ltp", "description": "语言技术平台（Language Technology Platform，LTP）是哈工大社会计算与信息检索研究中心开源的一整套中文语言处理系统。提供了一系列中文自然语言处理工具，这些工具可以用于中文文本进行分词、词性标注、句法分析等工作\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/HIT-SCIR/ltp", "stars": 5267, "forks": 1055, "watch": 246, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 7, "publish_at": "2017-04-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "68e09c7f251a4d31bce1377820f7898a", "name": "ngxtop", "full_name": "lebinh/ngxtop", "description": "解析 nginx 访问日志并格式化输出有用的信息，可以用来实时了解你的服务器正在发生的情况。安装命令 `pip install ngxtop`，输出示例如下：\n```\n$ ngxtop\nrunning for 411 seconds, 64332 records processed: 156.60 req/sec\n\nSummary:\n|   count |   avg_bytes_sent |   2xx |   3xx |   4xx |   5xx |\n|---------+------------------+-------+-------+-------+-------|\n|   64332 |         2775.251 | 61262 |  2994 |    71 |     5 |\n\nDetailed:\n| request_path                             |   count |   avg_bytes_sent |   2xx |   3xx |   4xx |   5xx |\n|------------------------------------------+---------+------------------+-------+-------+-------+-------|\n| /abc/xyz/xxxx                            |   20946 |          434.693 | 20935 |     0 |    11 |     0 |\n| /xxxxx.json                              |    5633 |         1483.723 |  5633 |     0 |     0 |     0 |\n| /xxxxx/xxx/xxxxxxx                       |    3624 |         7830.236 |  3621 |     0 |     3 |     0 |\n| /static/js/minified/utils.min.js         |    3031 |         1781.155 |  2104 |   927 |     0 |     0 |\n```\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/lebinh/ngxtop", "stars": 6521, "forks": 472, "watch": 203, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2017-04-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "c80ce845feb2432ab64854ade67e4660", "name": "searx", "full_name": "searx/searx", "description": "分分钟打造一个聚合的搜索引擎，使用简单，部署方便。拓展方便，基于插件式的管理。[演示地址](https://searx.me/)\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/searx/searx", "stars": 13563, "forks": 1687, "watch": 4, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 2, "publish_at": "2017-04-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 5, "category_name": "其它", "items": [{"rid": "764e0492f671440487ac5adfbdcff92d", "n